  designNotes: 'Epic pass: it removed aiming entirely (x1.59 DPS, 59% useful on the
    real rooms). Now its homing streams fire every third volley (Shots > Homing Volley
    Every), fly at 70% speed, turn at 4 rad/s (Player > Homing Turn Rate, was 7)
    and hit for 70%: x1.37 DPS. With Twin Spread the side streams home but fire less
    often: x1.38 against Twin Spread''s x1.30.'
